{start_of_verse: Primera Parte}
[Am]                   [F]         [C]   [Em]
There is One on the throne Jesus holy
[Am]                 [Dm]       [C]     [G]
He is worthy of praise, honor and glory
[Am]                     [F]       [C]   [Em]
There is One on the throne Jesus holy
[Am]               [Dm]         [C]     [G]
He is worthy of praise, honor and glory
{end_of_verse}

